SUMMARY:Brisbane German Week
DESCRIPTION:Brisbane German Week is an 18 day celebration of German culture
 \, ideas and connections across Brisbane. From film\, fashion and food to 
 business\, science and tradition\, the festival offers something for every
 one and showcases the many links between Brisbane and Germany. Discover a 
 side of Germany you may not expect\, meet new people and choose your Germa
 ny. Please note: This festival takes place over multiple days and across a
  variety of venues. For more information please visit Brisbane German Week
  Website . This event is proudly supported by Brisbane City Council.
LOCATION:Brisbane City Council Creative Events
URL:https://brisbanegermanweek.com.au/
